第三方组件 / Third-party components
----------------------------------

本仓库包含的第三方组件遵循其各自的许可证，不受上述声明约束：

  - `Desktop/public/live2d/` —— Live2D Cubism SDK 与示例模型
    参见 `Desktop/public/live2d/LICENSE.md` 与 `NOTICE.md`
  - `Desktop/public/fonts/` —— MiSans 字体
  - `Desktop/public/addons/` —— WebWord 加载项
  - `Desktop/public/spellcheck/` —— 拼写检查词库
  - 其他在文件或目录内另行注明来源与许可的内容

The third-party components bundled in this repository remain under their own
licenses and are not covered by the statement above. See the license and
notice files inside the corresponding directories.
